>1) I just tried to convert a temple.  I succeeded in doing so, but I lost
>telepathy in the process.  Now, I realize that you lose the intrinsic if
>you kill a peaceful human, but I converted the alter before I killed the
>priest. Now, the priest attacked me.  So, why did I lose telepathy? 
>He obviously wasn't peaceful, but he was the only potential cause
>(i.e. no gremlin encounters).  What gives?  This has happened twice now.

Lawful & neutral characters loose their telepathy if they kill a
_normally_ peaceful human. Priests are normally peaceful, even if
this particular priest wasn't too happy with you.

