>I had a ring of teleport control, but only gain the intrinsic after eating
>a tengu with it off.  I tried several tengus before with no luck.  Just my
>luck, or is this in the program?

No. But there is only a (fixed) probability of getting an intrinsic, in this
case 1 in 36 I think, but I lost my copy of the source code to a disk crash,
so I can't easily check.

